rred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1037,"digest":"sha256:3f1deb9a2bea1931350ee73a96188b66aa0faba3e9083735cf9761a5ad3906c2","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-27T13:38:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:38:17Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.4.27/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.4.27","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.4.27","body":"# 释手 0.4.27 · 修复蓝牙麦克风长期停在「准备中」\n\n构建号 `20261127-133306`（UTC）。\n\n- 蓝牙录音按所选麦克风绑定。释手会核对设备和音频格式，收到实际音频后才显示就绪。蓝牙耳机仍可同时用于收音和播放。\n- 每次准备最多等待 8 秒、最多尝试 3 次。遇到持续故障时，主窗口和设置会显示恢复方法。可以点击「重试麦克风」、重连设备，或将「声音播放」改为独立扬声器后重试。\n- 准备录音时可点击「取消准备」或按 Esc。旧请求的迟到回调会在新连接开始前清理。首字保护保留按键前 600 毫秒的声音，正常停止后继续收取 250 毫秒尾音。\n\n已用两只 USB 麦克风验证采音、显式设备选择与播放路由。DJI Mic Mini 的真实人声、连续十轮听写和文本框回填仍待故障机验收。\n\n使用 0.4.25 正式版或 0.4.26 RC1 的用户均可在「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新」安装本版，继续使用本机模型。\n"}